MNBox, from Mundus Novus
====================================
MNBox is a free music maker built on BeepBox, with a Composer that writes music with you.
Mundus Novus' own work is under the Mundus Novus License 1.0 (GPL-3.0-only); see LICENSE and LICENSING.md.
It grew out of Vigil Box (VigilTech, GPL-3.0-only), which grew out of AmerikaBox.

